    <bpmn:process id="W_W3469" name="W3469. Asset Lifecycle, Degradation &amp; Renewable Refresh/Repower Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Asset age/degradation analytics; warranty expiry; technology advance
Frequency: Annual + on trigger
Volume: Aging portfolio over time
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Fixed Asset (links to VS-35), Finance (links to VS-17), Procurement (links to VS-03)
Source: workflow W3469 — Asset Lifecycle, Degradation &amp; Renewable Refresh/Repower Planning</bpmn:documentation>
