      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3469_Start3" name="Asset age/degradation analytics; warranty expiry; technology advance">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3469_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3469_Task4" name="Energy Manager/Fixed Asset track asset lifecycle and degradation: annual yield…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Energy Manager/Fixed Asset track asset lifecycle and degradation: annual yield decline vs nameplate, component health (modules, inverters, BESS), warranty expiry (W3453/W3460), residual life, and asset-retirement obligation (links to VS-35); forecast end-of-life
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Fixed Asset
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3469_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3469_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3469_Task5" name="Energy Manager/Finance evaluate refresh/repower options: inverter replacement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Energy Manager/Finance evaluate refresh/repower options: inverter replacement, module upgrade (higher efficiency), BESS addition, or full repower; model economics vs continued operation (W3451 methodology) and technology/tariff outlook
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: On trigger</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3469_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3469_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3469_Task6" name="Energy Manager/Procurement plan and execute refresh/repower (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Energy Manager/Procurement plan and execute refresh/repower (links to W3452/W3453/W3454), retire/dispose of replaced assets per asset-retirement (links to VS-35.3) and e-waste rules (links to VS-99/VS-157), and update the asset register (links to VS-35) and roadmap (W3449)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Procurement / Fixed Asset
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: On trigger</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3469_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3469_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3469_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3469_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
